{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03979","headline":"晦日重宴 · 高正臣","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳辰重游衍，乘景共追随。\n班荆陪旧识，倾盖得新知。\n水叶分莲沼，风花落柳枝。\n自符河朔趣，宁羡高阳池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高正臣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}